#                 is skipped, and blocks holding several obligations are split by sentence)
# Hashes:         tools/extractor/clause_hash.py, rule per DECISIONS.md D-0008.
#
# Catalogued 2026-10-02 (DECISIONS.md D-0067). 57 requirements: 41 MUST, 5 SHOULD,
# 11 MAY. Every entry is Draft: the suite is an editor's draft, and the
